     md5     fad0f432ae18c330f9e14915fbf8960a
   The MD5 matches upstream's published fad0f432ae18c330f9e14915fbf8960a exactly, so the file
   the probe used is the one Astrodienst distribute, and the SHA-256 is now the strong hash to
   reproduce against. Nothing about the 500-of-538 result changes; this only replaces a weak
